        <mxCell id="n2" value="&lt;b&gt;STORY 03&lt;/b&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;fillColor=#111111;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Work Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DWork%2BSans;fontSize=22;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="140" y="40" width="150" height="46" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n3" value="New user · First login" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Work Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DWork%2BSans;fontSize=40;fontColor=#111111;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="310" y="38" width="2600" height="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n4" value="“As a new user, I want to log in for the first time.”" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Work Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DWork%2BSans;fontSize=24;fontColor=#374151;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="140" y="110" width="1500" height="32" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n5" value="What this storyboard shows" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Work Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DWork%2BSans;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111111;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="140" y="175" width="1500" height="23" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n6" value="• Starts from the invitation email sent when the owner creates the user (Story 02)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Work Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DWork%2BSans;fontSize=16;fontColor=#374151;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="158" y="204" width="1480" height="21" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n7" value="• The user activates the account by creating a password, then logs in for the first time." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Work Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DWork%2BSans;fontSize=16;fontColor=#374151;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="158" y="231" width="1480" height="21" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n8" value="• Errors modelled: weak / mismatching password, terms not accepted and a failed login with lockout rule." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Work Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DWork%2BSans;fontSize=16;fontColor=#374151;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="158" y="258" width="1480" height="21" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n9" value="• First landing is role-based (here a Coach) with an optional, skippable tour." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Work Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DWork%2BSans;fontSize=16;fontColor=#374151;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
