        <mxCell id="n3" value="Existing user · Password recovery" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Work Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DWork%2BSans;fontSize=40;fontColor=#111111;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="310" y="38" width="2600" height="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n4" value="“As an existing user, I want to recover my lost password.”" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Work Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DWork%2BSans;fontSize=24;fontColor=#374151;fontStyle=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="140" y="110" width="1500" height="32" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n5" value="What this storyboard shows" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Work Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DWork%2BSans;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111111;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="140" y="175" width="1500" height="23" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n6" value="• Starts on the log-in screen (“Forgot your password?”) and ends logging in with the new password." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Work Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DWork%2BSans;fontSize=16;fontColor=#374151;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="158" y="204" width="1480" height="21" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n7" value="• The reset link travels by email: the jump from the app to the inbox is an external event." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Work Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DWork%2BSans;fontSize=16;fontColor=#374151;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="158" y="231" width="1480" height="21" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n8" value="• Errors modelled: invalid email, expired / reused link, reused old password and mismatching passwords." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Work Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DWork%2BSans;fontSize=16;fontColor=#374151;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="158" y="258" width="1480" height="21" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n9" value="• Security rules are annotated: neutral confirmation message, rate limit and session sign-out." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;spacing=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Work Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DWork%2BSans;fontSize=16;fontColor=#374151;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
